subAnimJ CREDITS
================

subAnimJ is a derivative subset of the animCJK project, modified for use in
Japanese elementary school writing practice. This file enumerates the
upstream sources, their licenses, and the modifications applied here.

Upstream
--------

- animCJK
  - URL:       https://github.com/parsimonhi/animCJK
  - Copyright: 2016-2026 FM&SH (per upstream licenses/COPYING.txt)

  animCJK is itself derived from:

  - Arphic PL KaitiM GB font (font shapes for hanzi/kanji)
  - Arphic PL KaitiM Big5 font (font shapes for hanzi/kanji)
  - Makemeahanzi (https://github.com/skishore/makemeahanzi)
    Contributed the stroke decomposition data format and conversion approach.
  - Unihan dictionary (http://unicode.org/charts/unihan.html)
    Used for character decomposition data (not modified by subAnimJ).

